ctions/","original_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210706-twitter-reactions/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":5,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U776661HA","U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR","UD1FQV38V"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U776661HA","U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":4,"users":["U776661HA","U9S4G0LJW","U01NKCTP7B4","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cxio8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a49098e4-8e89-4b65-98a8-92d714ad1b46","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"人それぞれのようですね","ts":"1625545374.304100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vbO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb608359-712c-4f4d-b023-a1f07cf98fea","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"ぼくも受けました\n接種後3時間ほどで接種部の痛み (軽い筋肉痛程度) と発熱 (37.0度) でちょっとだるいかなくらいの症状が出て、翌日も同じような感じでした。\n3日目は接種部がまだ痛むかなーくらいで熱は下がりました。\n4日目で痛みも消えました。\n「接種部が痛くて横になれない」みたいなことはなく睡眠も食事も問題ありませんでした。\n一緒に受けた同僚の中にはもう少し高い熱が出た人、腕が痛くて横になれなかった人、全くなんともなくて本当にワクチンを打ってもらえたのか不安になる人がいました。\n\n参考になれば。","ts":"1625541180.303200","edited":{"user":"UEACRCY0Z","ts":"1625542599.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UEB0VGD7E","UDPT2BZ6E"]},{"name":"laughing","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ehE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f1dd40c-cf9c-4c51-a9db-c819cbef4b9c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1625537614.302500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oPA1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79153293-1c04-4f6b-9cbc-7d7912750b01","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"在宅なのでむちゃくちゃ焦ってやる、という感じでもないので気長に構える予定","ts":"1625536603.301700","edited":{"user":"U72TB62UF","ts":"1625536625.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":fa